# E3c review item 3 (host_api.c): JUINT and raw vector nodes inside a Json.Value payload; json_twin.script sends the same values as
# JSON text (run under the Elm twin and under Ficcus): the program's lines must be equal
sub output
sub jsonOut
deep jsonIn 0 u
deep jsonIn 0 v
deep jsonIn 2 u
deep jsonIn 2 v
vec jsonIn f64 3 -0 0.5
vec jsonIn u64 2 18446744073709547520 2048
vec jsonIn f32 2 0.1 1
vec jsonIn i8 3 -128 127
